 "notes": "Kept all four old kinds and added Dog training aids. Trimmed SKU lists to market-covering brands (Julius-K9, Ruffwear, Kurgo, Halti, flexi, TUG, HUNTER, Trixie) and turned families into archetypes. Dropped as SKU noise: generic marketplace models (Best Pet Supplies, IVY&LANE, PHOEPET, Petank, WINSEE, YIMEIS, BSEEN, Epesiri, ARING, Joytale, Ewinoom, Pawtitas, Nomad Tales repeats, etc.); old generic type rows moved into t. Head halters stay a type of collar, with Halti and Gentle Leader as archetypes. Martingale and slip are types. Left out: Hurtta products (no page retrieved; brand kept from knowledge); flexi model years and Baskerville launch year (not on retrieved pages); Wild One founding year (sources disagree, page not retrieved); Gentle Leader's move to PetSafe date (not found). fastcompany.com blocked (403)."
}